	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Voto meo<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11678">Nr. 1635</ref>, 32.</note> non satisfactum esse non dico doleo, nam <persName ref="p1419">Habio</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Dem neu gewählten <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Bürgermeister <persName ref="p1419">Johannes Haab</persName>.</note> nihil felicitatis in<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>video; sed miror alterum<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>.</note> non multis parasangis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Parasangen, persische Meilen.</note> praecessisse.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dominus bene vertat!</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Quod bene de ipso speratis, lubens audio<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief, auf den sich <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> hier wie auch unten Z. 8f bezieht, ist nicht erhalten.</note>; precor etiam, ne quid spem eam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>perturbet.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Apud nos quoque sabbato proximo<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Am 17. Juni.</note> eligetur consul<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Gewählt wurde <persName ref="p5996">Hemmann Offenburg</persName>; s. unten <ref target="file11680">Nr. 1637</ref>, 10-15.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Non est in tota <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>urbe, quem equidem nominare saltem possem; adeo desunt familię.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">De coelo dari <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>aliquem oportet; quare divinum ego suffragium implorare cogor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Quod rebus novis me implesti, gratum habeo; nam nihil prorsus novi, de quibus significasti.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Apud quosdam exposui; tum ipsi: „Audivimus quidem antea, sed noluimus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>esse incertorum authores“, unde intelligo rerum certitudinem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Timeo autem propter <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>foederatos<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Gemeint ist wohl: wegen der katholischen Eidgenossen.</note> olim nos mali aliquid passuros.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Verum quid tum?</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dicent multi ab <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>evangelio esse, ut quod inter nos dissidium fecerit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quod si probabitur, actum de nobis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>erit, qui praedicamus evangelium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Nemo vicinorum nostrorum in militiam abiit, unde sunt, qui divinant propter <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName> domi relictos, ut, si victoria steterit a se contra <persName ref="p18593">Turcam</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Sultan <persName ref="p18593">Suleiman I.</persName></note>, tum illi contra <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nos insurgant, praesertim multitudine profecta ad <persName ref="p20225">Gallum</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName> von <placeName ref="l832">Frankreich</placeName> stand soeben im Begriff, ein Kontingent eidgenössischer Söldner anzuwerben; s. Edouard <hi>Rott,</hi> Histoire de la Représentation Diplomatique de la France auprès des Cantons Suisses, de leurs Alliées et leurs Confédérés, Bd. I: 1430-1559, Bern 1900, S. 326f; <bibl source="b152">Cardauns</bibl> 218.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quodsi fortuna etiam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>cęsarianis adfulserit adversus <persName ref="p20225">Gallum</persName>, milites, quorum opera non esset opus, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>victoria parta profecturi sunt, inquiunt, similiter contra <placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName> per <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Alpes forsitan.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">In Inferiore quoque <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> manent omnes velut subs<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>idiarii Superiorum<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">D. h. der Oberdeutschen.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nec potest esse dubium, quin, qui sic divinant, non prorsus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sint vani.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Novi amicos inter exteros, quibus mirifice dolet, quod ta<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>le responsum cęsarianis datum est <placeName ref="l21">Badenae</placeName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">An der Tagsatzung vom 15. Mai war der Wunsch der <placeName ref="l822">deutschen</placeName> Reichsstände nach Beteiligung der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossen</placeName> am geplanten <placeName ref="l2510">Türkenfeldzug</placeName> zurückgewiesen worden; s. oben <ref target="file11673">Nr. 1630</ref>, Anm. 13.</note>, utpote qui verentur, ne<pb type="edition" next="96"/> quid ea <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>res sinistri nobis ferat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Nisi ergo dominus propter verbum nos tuebitur, ab <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>infortunio non aberimus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Agamus igitur nos officium et populum adhortemur <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ad poenitentiam nec desistamus, donec fiat aliquid.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Qui scis, an <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>dominus sit nostri miserturus?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Nondum vidi <persName ref="p8384">Ioannem Hospinianum</persName>, quem tuo et <persName ref="p8412">Gasparis</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p8412">Kaspar Megander</persName>.</note> nomine commendasti<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11678">Nr. 1635</ref>, 1-4.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Intellexi <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tamen hic esse et agere de sponsa<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p20737">Anna Schaffner</persName>.</note>, verum satis tepide.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Habet ancilla tutorem<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Unbekannt.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>qui re comperta effecit, ut ille audiretur, dumque rogaretur de bonis deque <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>cognatis, aiunt respondisse nec bona<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Korrigiert aus</hi> bonas.</note> nec cognatos sibi esse.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tum nihilominus<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">nihilominus <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> diem in<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>stitutum sponsaliorum; interea possit redire ad suos et ex eis adducere, siquidem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>agat serio, quos velit, secum, ut actio sit legitima.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Ita dicunt abiisse Ioannem.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>An rediturus sit vel quando, paenitus<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Kann auch als</hi> poenitus <hi>gelesen werden.</hi></note> ignoro; nam quę scribo, nescio qua ratione <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>acceperim.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Gaudeo pręterea vos omnes<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Gemeint sind <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliander</persName> und <persName ref="p8127">Pellikan</persName>; vgl. zuletzt oben <ref target="file11673">Nr. 1630</ref>, 1-8.</note> restitutos sanitati.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p1753">Leone</persName><note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note> aeque vobiscum doleo; <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>utinam dominus adsit ei, quo per patientiam possideat animam suam!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Authores tu<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>multus (ut hoc non omittam) nobiles viri dicunt esse procul dubio <persName ref="p19981">papam</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Papst <persName ref="p19981">Paul III.</persName></note>, Gallum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>et <persName ref="p18593">Turcam</persName> (de tumultu loquor <placeName ref="l522">Venetiano</placeName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Von den Gerüchten, auf die sich <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> anscheinend bezieht, ist sonst nichts bekannt.</note>); constare namque tres illos prorsus <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>consentire, et dum <placeName ref="l522">Veneti</placeName> ex foedere sexennali<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Von welchem Bündnis die Rede ist, bleibt unklar; zur Neutralität <placeName ref="l522">Venedigs</placeName> vgl. oben <ref target="file11674">Nr. 1631</ref>, Anm. 5.</note> (ut ita dicam) in eodem numero <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>esse putati sunt, intellexisse istos nescio quam defectionem, et inde ortum esse tu<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>multum.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Quęso te per dominum, ut nil nisi<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Zu ergänzen ist vielleicht: certa.</note> scribas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo cum tuis omnibus.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8412">Gasparum</persName>, omnes opto incolumes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 13. iunii anno 1542.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myco.</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>pręsuli <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vigilantissimo, fratri in domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>venerando suo.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zü[ric]h</placeName><note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Teilweise auf das nicht mehr vorhandene Verschlussband geschrieben.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
